OL,3,GNEWSACathedral staff offered redundancy
OL,4,Adue to finances
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cathedral has invited its staff to
OL,7,Ftake voluntary redundancy as it seeks
OL,8,Fto address a "significant" financial
OL,9,Fdeficit.
OL,11,FExeter Cathedral said it was a
OL,12,F"challenging time" as it faced "ongoing
OL,13,Ffinancial pressures".
OL,15,FIn an attempt to minimise expenditure
OL,16,Fit said it had launched a voluntary
OL,17,Fredundancy scheme, and "reduced working
OL,18,Fhours would be considered to prevent
OL,19,Fcompulsory job loses".
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
