OL,4,Adue to finances
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt added a complete review of its
OL,7,Fproperty portfolio was to be undertaken
OL,8,Fafter the closure of the Exeter
OL,9,FCathedral School and its subsequent
OL,10,Freturn to the cathedral along with
OL,11,Fother reduced rental income.
